:"An ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"open","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" enum. A value this SDK’s copy of the spec does not list decodes to ","type":"text"},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than failing the response it arrived in (CONTRACT.md §27.11 rule 1). Throwing there","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fails the WHOLE response, so one field of one record would take down the page it was on,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including the records the caller did ask for.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is never read as one of the KNOWN cases: reading a new value as whichever case happens to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be first turns a new server state into a wrong one, and on this surface these values gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access. "},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s own raw value is the empty string, which no server value is, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is never written: "},{"code":"encode(to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses it locally, before any request, as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"validation failure (CONTRACT.md §34.2 P12.2, contract 1.60 A4) — never as "},{"code":"\"\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", never left"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the server to refuse. A "},{"code":"switch","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" over these cases needs an "},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" arm."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/tenantkind"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersi